  "result": "the hypothesis is refuted: low-confidence items have a reasonably stable modal answer at 0.88 mean modal share, so they are labelable. What fails is the recorded single draw, which matches the modal answer in only 1 of 5 cases, and which returned unclear three times where repeats converge on a definite verdict.",
